Package: tempcomp-holdover
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), chrony, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/charlieh0tel/chrony-tempcomp
Description: holdover test for chronyd's tempcomp
 On a fixed cycle between two times, makes every chronyd source noselect
 for part of each cycle, so the clock holds over on its frequency and
 tempcomp, and gives the sources back after.  Removing it gives them back.
